# Clicks in a row in a text field (E6a). `name` is x 0..240, y 0..24,
# holding "Warm tones here" in 14 px Geist from x 3. A double click
# selects the word after the caret position nearest the point, as
# Chromium does: in Chromium x 36 to 42 select the space after "Warm",
# x 44 "tones".
listen pointerdown pointerup click input selectionchange
double-click 60 12            a double click on "tones" selects the word
expect event click input#name
expect selection input#name 5 10
type "hues"                   typed over the word: Warm hues here
expect event input input#name
expect selection input#name 9 9
double-click 15 12            "Warm"
expect selection input#name 0 4
double-click 39 12            the space after "Warm": the space alone
expect selection input#name 4 5
triple-click 60 12            the whole text
expect selection input#name 0 14
click 200 12                  a click in the selection: the caret placed on release
expect selection input#name 14 14
double-click 200 12           past the end: the last word
expect selection input#name 10 14
